The average age of 6 students is 20 years. If the age of one student is 25 years, what is the average age of the remaining 5 students?
A) 18 years
B) 19 years
C) 20 years
D) 21 years
Solution :
         Total=Average*Number
         Total=20*6
              = 120

120-25
95
95/5
19 years
Answer : B
